nfanzia vissuta in una famiglia numerosa e povera, segnata da tragici lutti, si passa all’adolescenza e alla giovinezza segnate da una profonda inettitudine sociale. Scambiata per schizofrenica, Janet trascorre otto anni in ospedali psichiatrici subendo centinaia di elettroshock, rischiando una lobotomia evitata solo grazie al successo letterario dei suoi primi racconti. Il viaggio prosegue infine verso l’Europa, dove la donna cercherà finalmente di trovare la propria voce e un senso di appartenenza."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Based on the autobiographical work of New Zealand writer Janet Frame, this production depicts the author at various stage of her life. Afflicted with mental and emotional issues, Frame grows up in an impoverished family and experiences numerous tragedies while still in her youth, including the deaths of two of her siblings. Portrayed as an adult by Kerry Fox, Frame finds acclaim for her writing while still in a mental institution, and her success helps her move on with her life.","tagline":"Based on the autobiographies of Janet Frame"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6MEoveXKdVky2K2t8WsNIZB3Ezn.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eDX4FucYbcuK1qKGEuh7gbE97SX.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":2891,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6MEoveXKdVky2K2t8WsNIZB3Ezn.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6MEoveXKdVky2K2t8WsNIZB3Ezn.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6MEoveXKdVky2K2t8WsNIZB3Ezn.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6MEoveXKdVky2K2t8WsNIZB3Ezn.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qdaQ1U